%% Sequence Diagram for Parent-Managed Youth Account Management (Mermaid)
sequenceDiagram
    participant Parent as Parent/Guardian
    participant WebApp as Web UI (React)
    participant API as Youth Account API (Spring Boot)
    participant Auth as OAuth2 Auth Service
    participant DB as Account DB (PostgreSQL)
    participant Settings as Youth Account Settings
    participant Payment as Payment Service
    participant Ledger as Transaction Ledger
    Note over Parent,API: All API calls require OAuth2 Bearer token, RBAC, and audit logging
    Parent->>WebApp: Login (OAuth2)
    WebApp->>Auth: Authenticate (OAuth2)
    Auth-->>WebApp: Auth token (JWT)
    Parent->>WebApp: View Dashboard
    WebApp->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/dashboard [Bearer]
    API->>Auth: Validate token & RBAC
    Auth-->>API: OK
    API->>DB: Fetch youth account
    API->>Settings: Fetch spending limit
    API->>Ledger: Fetch recent transactions
    API-->>WebApp: Dashboard data (account, limit, transactions)
    WebApp-->>Parent: Display dashboard
    Note over Parent,API: Fund Transfer
    Parent->>WebApp: Transfer Funds
    WebApp->>API: POST /api/youth-accounts/{id}/fund-transfer {amount, account} [Bearer]
    API->>Auth: Validate token & RBAC
    Auth-->>API: OK
    API->>Payment: Initiate fund transfer
    Payment-->>API: Transfer result
    API->>DB: Update account balance
    API-->>WebApp: Transfer response
    WebApp-->>Parent: Show result
    Note over Parent,API: Set Spending Limit
    Parent->>WebApp: Set Limit
    WebApp->>API: PUT /api/youth-accounts/{id}/spending-limit {limit} [Bearer]
    API->>Auth: Validate token & RBAC
    Auth-->>API: OK
    API->>Settings: Update limit
    API-->>WebApp: Limit updated
    WebApp-->>Parent: Show result
    Note over Parent,API: View Transactions
    Parent->>WebApp: View Transactions
    WebApp->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/transactions [Bearer]
    API->>Auth: Validate token & RBAC
    Auth-->>API: OK
    API->>Ledger: Fetch transactions
    API-->>WebApp: Transaction list
    WebApp-->>Parent: Show transactions
    Note over API: All actions logged for audit and compliance